# 🔧 Components List — Land Safe Explorer

## Core Components

| # | Component | Model | Qty | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Microcontroller | Arduino Mega 2560 | 1 | Main brain |
| 2 | GPS Module | NEO-6M (GY-NEO6MV2) | 1 | Location & waypoint nav |
| 3 | Motor Driver | L298N Dual H-Bridge | 1 | Wheel motor control |
| 4 | Metal Detector Module | Inductive sensor | 1 | Metal/mine detection |
| 5 | Robot Chassis | 4WD Smart Car Kit | 1 | Base platform |
| 6 | SD Card Module | SPI SD Module | 1 | GPS data logging |
| 7 | DC Gear Motors | TT Motor 3-6V | 4 | Locomotion |
| 8 | Li-Po Battery | 7.4V 2200mAh | 1 | Power supply |
| 9 | Buck Converter | LM2596 | 1 | Voltage regulation |
| 10 | Jumper Wires | M-M / M-F / F-F | — | Connections |

## Optional / GPR Expansion

| # | Component | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 11 | Ultrasonic Sensor (HC-SR04) | Obstacle avoidance |
| 12 | Bluetooth Module (HC-05) | Wireless monitoring |
| 13 | OLED Display (0.96") | Live status display |
| 14 | Buzzer | Alert on detection |

## Pin Connections

### GPS Module (NEO-6M) → Arduino Mega
| NEO-6M Pin | Arduino Pin |
|---|---|
| VCC | 5V |
| GND | GND |
| TX | RX1 (Pin 19) |
| RX | TX1 (Pin 18) |

### L298N Motor Driver → Arduino Mega
| L298N Pin | Arduino Pin |
|---|---|
| IN1 | Pin 2 |
| IN2 | Pin 3 |
| IN3 | Pin 4 |
| IN4 | Pin 5 |
| ENA | Pin 9 (PWM) |
| ENB | Pin 10 (PWM) |

### SD Card Module → Arduino Mega
| SD Pin | Arduino Pin |
|---|---|
| CS | Pin 53 |
| MOSI | Pin 51 |
| MISO | Pin 50 |
| SCK | Pin 52 |
| VCC | 5V |
| GND | GND |
